{"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"<p>This page tests the markdown capabilities of this blog / website platform.</p>\n"},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"<h1>Top level heading (h1)</h1>\n<h2>Heading h2</h2>\n<h3>Heading h3</h3>\n<h4>Heading h4</h4>\n<h5>Heading h5</h5>\n<h6>Heading h6</h6>\n"},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"<h2>Bullet Points</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit.</li>\n<li>Sed ut turpis vitae risus imperdiet ultrices.\n<ul>\n<li>Cras condimentum libero eget dui mattis, nec congue velit tempor.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Ut suscipit magna eu dui facilisis, nec commodo lacus euismod.</li>\n</ul>\n"},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"<h2>Numbered Lists</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit.</li>\n<li>Sed ut turpis vitae risus imperdiet ultrices.\n<ol>\n<li>Cras condimentum libero eget dui mattis, nec congue velit tempor.</li>\n<li>Ut suscipit magna eu dui facilisis, nec commodo lacus euismod.\n<ol>\n<li>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit.</li>\n<li>Sed ut turpis vitae risus imperdiet ultrices.</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>Cras condimentum libero eget dui mattis, nec congue velit tempor.</li>\n<li>Ut suscipit magna eu dui facilisis, nec commodo lacus euismod.</li>\n</ol>\n"},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"<h2>Task List</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>[x] Write the press release</li>\n<li>[ ] Update the website</li>\n<li>[ ] Contact the media</li>\n</ul>\n"},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"<h2>Code handling</h2>\n<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Curabitur tempus massa ut feugiat pellentesque. <code>Curabitur iaculis nisi eu nisl posuere viverra. Nunc nibh risus</code>, efficitur eu urna eget, pellentesque semper nibh. Nam congue, nisl ac egestas suscipit, ipsum tortor dictum metus, vitae <code>iaculis massa nibh vel enim. Maecenas semper</code> mi a libero pharetra, vel viverra turpis porttitor. Donec cursus ullamcorper euismod. Sed maximus eu est ac sodales. Nulla rhoncus egestas arcu vitae cursus. Fusce eget laoreet diam, nec vestibulum lacus.</p>\n<p>Code block:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs\">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Curabitur tempus massa ut feugiat pellentesque. Curabitur iaculis nisi eu nisl posuere viverra. Nunc nibh risus, efficitur eu urna eget, pellentesque semper nibh. Nam congue, nisl ac egestas suscipit, ipsum tortor dictum metus, vitae iaculis massa nibh vel enim. Maecenas semper mi a libero pharetra, vel viverra turpis porttitor. Donec cursus ullamcorper euismod. Sed maximus eu est ac sodales. Nulla rhoncus egestas arcu vitae cursus. Fusce eget laoreet diam, nec vestibulum lacus.\n</code></pre>\n<p>JSX code block:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs text-sm\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">default</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">BlogHero</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">props: BlogHeroProps</span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> (\n    <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">Link</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">href</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">{props.href}</span>&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">article</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">className</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;blog-hero my-4 bg-slate-200 shadow-lg rounded-lg border-1 hover:shadow-2xl&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">section</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">className</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;p-4 pb-0 flex flex-row&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n          <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">className</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;text-1xl text-slate-700 mr-8&quot;</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">User</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">className</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;inline-block w-[16pt] h-[16pt]&quot;</span> /&gt;</span> {props.author}<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n          <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">className</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;text-1xl text-slate-700 mr-8&quot;</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">Calendar</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">className</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;inline-block w-[16pt] h-[16pt]&quot;</span> /&gt;</span> {props.published}<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">section</span>&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h1</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">className</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;p-4 pb-0 text-4xl mb-2&quot;</span>&gt;</span>{props.title}<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h1</span>&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">section</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">className</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;p-4 nbsection&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n          <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">JupyterHtmlSectionRenderer</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">html</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">{props.preview}</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">notebook</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">{null}</span> /&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">section</span>&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">section</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">className</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;border-t-[1px] border-t-slate-950 p-4&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n          <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">className</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;text-lg text-bold text-slate-950 dark:text-slate-50&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Continue reading...<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">section</span>&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">article</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">Link</span>&gt;</span></span>\n  )\n}\n</code></pre>\n"},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"<h2>Math</h2>\n<p>Sure thing! Here’s a bunch of equations that can stress-test MathJax in different ways, including rendering speed, nested expressions, alignment, and special symbols.</p>\n<h3>1. Basic Stress Test (Large Expression)</h3>\n<p>Nunc nibh risus, efficitur eu urna eget, pellentesque semper nibh <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" style=\"position: relative;\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.091ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24.892ex\" height=\"3.048ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -864.9 11002.2 1347.1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"munderover\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><path data-c=\"2211\" d=\"M61 748Q64 750 489 750H913L954 640Q965 609 976 579T993 533T999 516H979L959 517Q936 579 886 621T777 682Q724 700 655 705T436 710H319Q183 710 183 709Q186 706 348 484T511 259Q517 250 513 244L490 216Q466 188 420 134T330 27L149 -187Q149 -188 362 -188Q388 -188 436 -188T506 -189Q679 -189 778 -162T936 -43Q946 -27 959 6H999L913 -249L489 -250Q65 -250 62 -248Q56 -246 56 -239Q56 -234 118 -161Q186 -81 245 -11L428 206Q428 207 242 462L57 717L56 728Q56 744 61 748Z\"></path></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1089,477.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><path data-c=\"221E\" d=\"M55 217Q55 305 111 373T254 442Q342 