":"stderr","output_type":"stream","text":["Hello, 1","Hello, 3","Hello, 5","Hello, 7","Hello, 9"]},{"ename":"AttributeError","evalue":"'NoneType' object has no attribute 'length'","output_type":"error","traceback":["<span style=\"color:#A00\">---------------------------------------------------------------------------</span>","<span style=\"color:#A00\">AttributeError</span>                            Traceback (most recent call last)","Cell <span style=\"color:#0A0\">In[9], line 12</span><br/><b><span style=\"color:#0A0\">      9</span></b>         <span style=\"color:#008700\">print<span style=\"color:#FFF\">(<span style=\"color:#af0000\">f<span style=\"color:#FFF\"><span style=\"color:#af0000\">&apos;<span style=\"color:#FFF\"><span style=\"color:#af0000\">Hello, <span style=\"color:#FFF\"><blink><b>{<span style=\"color:#FFF\"></span></b></blink></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>i<blink><b>}<span style=\"color:#FFF\"></span></b></blink><span style=\"color:#af0000\">&apos;<span style=\"color:#FFF\">, file<span style=\"color:#626262\">=<span style=\"color:#FFF\">sys<span style=\"color:#626262\">.<span style=\"color:#FFF\">stderr)<br/><b><span style=\"color:#0A0\">     11</span></b></span></span></span></span></span></span> string <span style=\"color:#626262\">=<span style=\"color:#FFF\"> <blink><b>None<span style=\"color:#FFF\"></span></b></blink></span></span><br/><span style=\"color:#0A0\">---&gt; 12</span> <span style=\"background-color:#A50\">string<span style=\"background-color:#000\"><blink><span style=\"background-color:#A50\">.<span style=\"color:#FFF\"><span style=\"background-color:#000\"><span style=\"background-color:#A50\">length<span style=\"background-color:#000\"></span></span></span></span></span></blink></span></span>","<span style=\"color:#A00\">AttributeError</span>: &apos;NoneType&apos; object has no attribute &apos;length&apos;"]}],"source":"<pre><code class=\"hljs\"># Stdout, stderr and runtime error\n\nimport sys\n\nfor i in range(10):\n    if i % 2 == 0:\n        print(f'Hello, {i}')\n    else:\n        print(f'Hello, {i}', file=sys.stderr)\n\nstring = None\nstring.length</code></pre>"},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"<h2>Images</h2>\n<p>Image, but in Markdown:</p>\n<p><img src=\"attachment:8889179e-b6ef-4ddd-b654-cae211fc8a20.png\" alt=\"AI-generated abstract image\" /></p>\n<p>Image, but as HTML with defined width and height</p>\n<img src=\"attachment:d8097420-bf40-4389-b4f8-6e71401e39f4.webp\" alt=\"Another AI-generated abstract image\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" />\n<p>Oooh, and images prerender scaled to the max width of the site preferences.</p>\n<p><img src=\"attachment:2ff3a2dd-01cd-45ef-94a4-c5be538eeadc.png\" alt=\"image.png\" /></p>\n"},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"<h2>Links</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://bing.com\">Bing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://google.com\">Google</a></li>\n</ul>\n"},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"<h2>Text Styles Joy Emoji - 😂</h2>\n<p><em>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Curabitur tempus massa ut feugiat pellentesque. Curabitur iaculis nisi eu nisl posuere viverra. Nunc nibh risus, efficitur eu urna eget, pellentesque semper nibh. Nam congue, nisl ac egestas suscipit, ipsum tortor dictum metus, vitae iaculis massa nibh vel enim. Maecenas semper mi a libero pharetra, vel viverra turpis porttitor. Donec cursus ullamcorper euismod. Sed maximus eu est ac sodales. Nulla rhoncus egestas arcu vitae cursus. Fusce eget laoreet diam, nec vestibulum lacus.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Orci varius natoque penatibus et magnis dis parturient montes, nascetur ridiculus mus. Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Aliquam a placerat lorem. Mauris eget ipsum sit amet purus pharetra dignissim id ut felis. Curabitur a sapien rhoncus, iaculis dui vel, sollicitudin lorem. Curabitur et dictum magna. Aenean molestie sapien in massa laoreet, sit amet mattis libero finibus. Proin a tristique justo. Sed vitae tincidunt lec